---
// Fundations
import Text from "@/components/fundations/elements/Text.astro";
import Wrapper from "@/components/fundations/containers/Wrapper.astro";
---

<section>
    <Wrapper variant="standard" class="pb-8">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-4 items-start gap-y-8">
            <Text
                tag="h2"
                variant="displayXL"
                class="font-semibold leading-snug text-left tracking-tighter lg:col-span-2 text-base-900 dark:text-white lg:col-start-1"
            >
                What we do
            </Text>
        </div>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-4 items-start gap-y-8 mt-10">
            <Text
                tag="h3"
                variant="displayMD"
                class="font-semibold leading-snug text-left tracking-tighter lg:col-span-2 text-base-900 dark:text-white lg:col-start-1"
            >
                01. SEO (Search Engine Optimisation)
            </Text>

            <Text
                tag="p"
                variant="textLG"
                class="lg:col-start-1 dark:text-white lg:col-span-2"
            >
                The groundwork, core web vitals, site architecture, structured data, and keyword research done properly so nothing holds your rankings back.
            </Text>
        </div>

                <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-4 items-start gap-y-8 mt-20">
            <Text
                tag="h3"
                variant="displayMD"
                class="font-semibold leading-snug text-left tracking-tighter lg:col-span-2 text-base-900 dark:text-white lg:col-start-1"
            >
                02. GEO (Generative Engine Optimisation)
        </Text>

        <Text
            tag="p"
            variant="textLG"
            class="lg:col-start-1 dark:text-white lg:col-span-2">
                Getting your content cited and recommended when people ask ChatGPT, Perplexity, or other AI Overviews for recommendations. This works because the content is worth citing, showing Experience, Expertise, Authoritativeness, and Trustworthiness (E-E-A-T).      
            </Text>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-4 items-start gap-y-8 mt-20">
            <Text
                tag="h3"
                variant="displayMD"
                class="font-semibold leading-snug text-left tracking-tighter lg:col-span-2 text-base-900 dark:text-white lg:col-start-1"
            >
                03. AEO (Answer Engine Optimisation)
            </Text>
            <Text
                tag="p"
                variant="textXL"
                class="lg:col-start-1 dark:text-white lg:col-span-2">
                    Structuring your content so search engines and AI assistants can find the key points and use them, moving your website and content towards searchable and findable rather than invisible.
            </Text>
        </div> 

          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-4 items-start gap-y-8 mt-20">
            <Text
                tag="h3"
                variant="displayMD"
                class="font-semibold leading-snug text-left tracking-tighter lg:col-span-2 text-base-900 dark:text-white lg:col-start-1"
            >
             04. Writing & Content
            </Text>
            <Text
                tag="p"
                variant="textXL"
                class="lg:col-start-1 dark:text-white lg:col-span-2">
                The foundation on which the above actually depend on. Product pages, guides, and brand content written properly. Never templated, keyword-stuffed or generated, just authentic and enhanced content that ranks and gets cited, driving more traffic to your website. 
            </Text>
        </div>
    </Wrapper>
</section>